{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_title", "source_sha256": "28fd8c7eaa2b3709478cb661c5eaa3cc108693aa5dcbce7c6c62430f669b1dab", "ja": "純真Days！", "zh": "纯真Days！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0b4f08580fd580de6119e873816604e982679d9c3308b9af028bd0d191159dae", "ja": "星梨花のセンターが決まり、彼女を支えよう\nと仲間たちが集結した。ファンを楽しませる\nために出てくるアイディアの中から星梨花が\n選んだ答えは『いつも通りに』。力を出し切\nった星梨花は、ステージを成功させる。", "zh": "星梨花被选为Center，于是同伴们为了\n帮助她而聚在一起。在各种能满足粉丝的提案\n之中，星梨花选出的答案是『一切照常』。\n而全力以赴的星梨花，也顺利完成了表演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1000_p", "source_sha256": "5ddf9ab0a5deb9a5aeb43b18331e4acab6b0b2e533fe363f7e5018d36e8e5ce3", "ja": "（星梨花のセンター公演が無事終了した！\n会場中に笑顔が溢れた、とてもいいライブだったな）", "zh": "（星梨花的Center公演顺利结束了！\n会场中充满笑容，是场非常棒的演唱会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "daec6f90c0c955168c62f959e9a92323269a0aeab8d639f18eae8426f9f69506", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……。\nあの、{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "呼、呼……\n那个，{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3883a1300f284c3e2b042ded42a7d3a05af27e4ad01c45a52efabb6eb1b08267", "ja": "お帰り、星梨花！\nどうだ？　公演、楽しかったか？", "zh": "欢迎回来，星梨花！\n怎么样？公演开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "6d23b2e5d76651ea4a31406c67b82378b0fe6d57a3a6e3b28949ac1afdf3c6a3", "ja": "はいっ！　わたし、一生懸命頑張りました！\nステージから見るファンのみなさん、楽しそうで……。", "zh": "是的！我尽全力努力表演了！\n我从舞台上看到粉丝们感觉好像都很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "b447d3feb8850acdd80479f8365d9dd2117576ef30e31ab56f39db5daedffd77", "ja": "わたし……わたし、センターやってよかったです！\nみんなを笑顔にできて、よかったです！", "zh": "我……我能成为Center真是太好了！\n能让大家都露出笑容，真的太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "b48893036f7b63713392db2b87b20a1395d308f30e6a80bfc6448b8895de8221", "ja": "{$P$}さん。\nわたし、またセンターやりたいです！　いいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。\n我还想要再当Center！可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7a7177e5dd2a15ecf1905c5e9acc36fd034d15e336ad8cfea435324030828100", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　星梨花に、センターを\n任せた甲斐があった。本当にいい公演だったよ！", "zh": "嗯，当然！交给星梨花来担任Center的效果很好。\n真的是场很精彩的公演喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "ef5855fb57d9c460c3cb43c2a41f1b9a9f91d96dadd424d79939354cb770b799", "ja": "えへへ……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "f7ad5d84b2ec004d34a2cb8e99ab31041054f159c852a72b96a32f841b6d8797", "ja": "星梨花～！", "zh": "星梨花——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1009_022ser", "source_sha256": "f80c91f1b955d41c42c4dbb0a36b7b4fcd77df3f9d419ebbbee64d2350d9bd85", "ja": "あ……桃子ちゃん、エミリーちゃん！", "zh": "啊……小桃、小艾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1010_049mom", "source_sha256": "e416c978d1fcb32da5a17b8c733ae248c8164975ed7c5764dabe04127ce27b92", "ja": "もう！　公演が終わって、\nすぐに走って行っちゃうから、びっくりしたよ。", "zh": "真是的！你公演一结束就跑走，\n吓了桃子一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "43a17f92fe86f7c3fc86ba42c2a828b10060a42e12bd3f7ef87a4fa27a6dc140", "ja": "ふふっ。それだけ早く、仕掛け人さまに\n今日の公演のことを伝えたかったんですよね？", "zh": "呵呵，你很想赶快和策划执行人先生\n报告今天公演的事对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "abb4eb9d3f3541660f5c5d11b92b1af2b8efc59b0bdab8a36d58ed4d5c9d7e70", "ja": "ごヒイキ様方に、たくさん喜んでいただけました。\nとても楽しい舞台だったと思います♪", "zh": "主顾们都非常开心。\n是场让大家都十分尽兴的表演♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "3fb91d8b617827142241845df198b312880a4df84c5def61df20cf27d77e935d", "ja": "まあ、そうだね。桃子も、いいライブだったと思うよ。\n星梨花、お疲れさま。", "zh": "嗯，是啊，桃子也觉得这场演唱会很棒。\n星梨花，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "e9910cc9c22b9e1f25df3e9b58dfbc74c6ddea55237e225218d187938f8a659a", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます！\nあの……桃子ちゃん、エミリーちゃん！", "zh": "谢、谢谢你们！\n那个……小桃、小艾！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "66e079b46a13ad0a3a55a094d54bd61330365ecb8201a71740b52c720bf4d18e", "ja": "はい、なんでしょうか？", "zh": "是，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "712e99b045ec6509a384524420a2b6bc1a1a881813774c49a6e5bace97ee6cbd", "ja": "わたし、ひとりだけだったら……\n今日の公演、きっとうまくいかなかったと思います！", "zh": "如果只有我一个人……\n一定没办法让今天的公演顺利完成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "cf3b55bd57426493aa26e40848eb0b2305f23e9541f661d03451a63ecd869a09", "ja": "本番の前も、みんなが声を掛けてくれたから、\n緊張しなくなったんです！", "zh": "正式开始前，也是因为有大家的关心，\n我才不再紧张！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "e8cea770fd65015c352a9855620133e72a3948acbaa8b87b3ff8fc111a2f2eca", "ja": "だから……\nいっぱい助けてくれて、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "所以……\n谢谢你们帮我这么多忙♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "f7e65830d64da2cccd045dff2c729cad86ee8456868a5d78f4950630c2420458", "ja": "べ、別に、お礼なんて言う必要ないよ。\n桃子達はプロだし、当たり前のことをしただけだよ。", "zh": "你、你不需要特别道谢啦。\n桃子我们毕竟是专业的，只是做好应尽的本分而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "2b0fd2d2910aa55bd69da216eca52649e63716a2c820da822549231a01952200", "ja": "はい。お互いを支え合うのが、和の心……\n大和撫子の心ですものね♪", "zh": "没错，互助合作就是和之心……\n也是大和抚子之心唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1021_022ser", "source_sha256": "650a961173ff60ca1f436ea01a26b680e9ccc793156173ae4b7e87ca4e24a07a", "ja": "けど……。", "zh": "可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1022_049mom", "source_sha256": "8c104da7ccff827cc0baebec4c0c0a24a2219fcfaa5781c97784539caacfb4d0", "ja": "それでも、星梨花がお礼を言いたいって言うなら……\n桃子達がセンターになった時に、手伝って。いい？", "zh": "就算我们这么说，星梨花也还是想道谢的话……\n等桃子我们当Center时，你也要来帮忙，好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "0ce33bf6a4233a9e45c6ce7ca3bab51cd7636167646b2658526f16edd8461f30", "ja": "はい、もちろんです！\nわたし、みなさんのこと、お手伝いしますね♪", "zh": "好的，一定会！\n我会帮忙大家的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1024_032emi", "source_sha256": "d3cf4eb6bf860741632f7aee6dae86407fd55bfdf47d6d175cb1d3bf04df7284", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nそれじゃ、そろそろ楽屋に戻りましょうか。", "zh": "谢谢你。\n那我们也差不多该回休息室了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "9198821465b11a63248e89c56cfdf7e52687a7211ff02604ca74291a1e9af8b9", "ja": "楽屋……あっ、そうでした！\n麗花さんと紗代子さんにも、お礼を言ってきます！", "zh": "休息室……啊，对了！\n我去和丽花姊姊还有纱代子姊姊道个谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1026_049mom", "source_sha256": "0d0fb15eecb24455fc88ad7bf5726678217639a21f82ce731187b2095dc5ab2e", "ja": "えっ？　せ、星梨花！\nちょっと待ってってば……！", "zh": "咦？星、星梨花！\n你等一下啦……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1027_032emi", "source_sha256": "6cf1fc5d24025e734d4255c1247151fe1f0ed47d4e1045b02566e8c0b185fdb2", "ja": "あ、わ、私も……\n仕掛け人さま、また後で……！", "zh": "啊，我、我也一起去……\n策划执行人先生，等等见……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1028_se", "source_sha256": "632766b1963bbd5d65cd118f29217ec32140023fcf0802dafb4fd7ef14cacead", "ja": "パタパタパタ……", "zh": "啪哒啪哒啪哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0a1a5670f26d84646c36fa2b095bbc30a1f661ecce27d81c7850c0a8bbab871a", "ja": "（星梨花が、みんなに愛される理由……\nそれは星梨花の言葉には、嘘がないからだろう）", "zh": "（星梨花之所以会受大家喜爱……\n是因为她说话非常诚恳吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_007_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_007_1030_p", "source_sha256": "08b32873c80de404084809bcab1672186f57056dd7178df13e4a296c5ceace4e", "ja": "（真っ直ぐで素直な星梨花は、たくさんのことを\n吸収して育つだろう。これからが楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（正直又坦率的星梨花，会继续吸收许多经验\n成长茁壮吧。期待她未来的发展！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
